#NEXUS

[ averianov2010a_fig9: Theropod summary ladder, fully resolved. Tetanurae, Coelurosauria and Maniraptora, joined by arrows to nodes, are kept as internal labels. 15 tips, fully resolved; 3 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

